os particiones o discos duros el C y el D \n<br>En el C se instala los programas y el otro se utiliza para guardar los archivos.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"http://www.mitarija.com/7-centavos/\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Leer mas&nbsp; &gt;</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <a href=\"textospdf.html\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/discolsolido-696x391.jpg\" alt></a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Disco sólido.</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                            <i>Card Subtitle</i>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Actualmente ya existen discos sólidos, este tipo de discos, hacen que una laptop sea más veloz.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"http://www.mitarija.com/category/matematicas/\" class=\"btn it